{"id":"n2-035","title":"Noun を もとにして","romaji":"Noun wo moto ni shite","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Based on; using; utilizing.","longExplanation":"The 'Noun をもとにして' grammar point is used to express that something is done based on, using, or utilizing the noun. It indicates that the noun is the foundation, source or basis for the action or statement.","formation":"Noun + をもとにして","examples":[{"jp":"彼の意見をもとにして、計画を変更しました。","romaji":"Kare no iken o moto ni shite, keikaku o henkō shimashita.","en":"Based on his opinion, we changed the plan.","words":[{"surface":"彼の","vocabId":"1000420","reading":"かれの"},{"surface":"意見","vocabId":"1156530","reading":"いけん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もと","vocabId":"1260670","reading":"もと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"計画","vocabId":"1252090","reading":"けいかく"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"変更","vocabId":"1511040","reading":"へんこう"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4,5,6]},{"jp":"この小説は実話をもとにして書かれています。","romaji":"Kono shōsetsu wa jitsuwa o moto ni shite kakarete imasu.","en":"This novel is written based on a true story.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"小説","vocabId":"1348430","reading":"しょうせつ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"実話","vocabId":"1321580","reading":"じつわ"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もと","vocabId":"1260670","reading":"もと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"書か","vocabId":"1343950","reading":"かか","baseForm":"書く"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6,7,8]},{"jp":"資料をもとにして、レポートを作成しました。","romaji":"Shiryō o moto ni shite, repōto o sakusei shimashita.","en":"I created the report based on the materials.","words":[{"surface":"資料","vocabId":"1312820","reading":"しりょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もと","vocabId":"1260670","reading":"もと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レポート","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"作成","vocabId":"1297760","reading":"さくせい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"過去の成功例をもとにして、新しいプロジェクトを進める予定です。","romaji":"Kako no seikōrei o moto ni shite, atarashii purojekuto o susumeru yotei desu.","en":"We plan to proceed with the new project based on past successful examples.","words":[{"surface":"過去","vocabId":"1196030","reading":"かこ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成功","vocabId":"1375690","reading":"せいこう"},{"surface":"例","vocabId":"1585230","reading":"れい"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もと","vocabId":"1260670","reading":"もと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"新しい","vocabId":"1361490","reading":"あたらしい"},{"surface":"プロジェクト","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"進める","vocabId":"1365990","reading":"すすめる"},{"surface":"予定","vocabId":"1543240","reading":"よてい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6,7,8]}],"kind":"construction"}